  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">齊<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p001:m0001" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">蕭道成</persName>母<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p001:m0005" ref="pib_5me_1wm_A">陳后</persName></p>
  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">蕭子顯《齊書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002:m0009" ref="pib_5me_1wm_A">宣孝陳皇后</persName>，諱<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002:m0016" ref="pib_5me_1wm_A">道正</persName>，臨淮東陽人。後生<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002:m0027" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>。太祖年二歲，乳人乏乳，後夢人以兩甌麻粥與之，覺而乳大出，异而悅之。<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002:m0063" ref="egx_xax_4ic">宣帝</persName>從任在外，後常留家治事，教子孫。有相者謂後曰：「夫人有貴子而不見之。」後嘆曰：「我三兒，誰當應之。」呼太祖小字曰：「正應是汝。」太祖雖從官，而家業本貧，爲建康令時，<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-chendaozhi:p002:m0147" ref="w4m_9tw_147">高宗</persName>等冬月猶無縑纊，而奉膳甚厚，後每撤去兼肉，曰：「我于此過足矣。」殂于縣舍，年七十三。建元元年，重追尊孝皇后。</p>
</text>
